WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

NOTE Descriptive captions for a silent animation. Timings match wilkes_basin_present_pliocene_animation_web.mp4 (19 s). Vertical exaggeration 100x.

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Present day: the ice sheet over the Wilkes
Subglacial Basin. Purple to yellow lines
show ice flow speed (20–500 m per year).

00:04.000 --> 00:05.000
Flow lines switch off.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.500
Dissolving to a modelled ice sheet under a
past warm climate with higher CO2 (Pliocene-like).

00:07.500 --> 00:13.500
The ice has retreated far inland, exposing
the basin: the warm-climate configuration.

00:13.500 --> 00:16.000
Dissolving back to the present-day ice sheet.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
Present day again, with ice flow lines.
